<title>UK: JFM sets 1.0 bln French franc 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>JFM sets 1.0 bln French franc 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers IBJ and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   JAPAN FINANCE CORP FOR MUNICIPAL ENTERPRISES</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  JAPAN</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    09.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.631    PAY DATE    09.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    99.631    SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA     DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 5.5 PCT 2007 AND 8.5 PCT 2008 OATS -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
